; Terminal multiplexer written in Rust.
; More information: https://zellij.dev/documentation/

% zellij

# Start a new session
zellij

% zellij

# List sessions
zellij list-sessions

% zellij

# Attach to a session
zellij attach <session>

% zellij

# Start a named session
zellij -s <name>

% zellij

# Start with a specific layout
zellij --layout <layout_file>

% zellij

# Kill a session
zellij kill-session <session>

% zellij

# Delete all sessions
zellij delete-all-sessions

; Keybindings (default locked mode, Ctrl-g to unlock, then use Ctrl+key combos):
; Ctrl-g        lock/unlock
; Ctrl-p n      new pane
; Ctrl-p x      close pane
; Ctrl-p ↑/↓/←/→  move focus
; Ctrl-t n      new tab
; Ctrl-t x      close tab
